//! WDC 65C816 CPU
//!
//! The WDC 65C816 is a 16-bit extension of the 65C02. The CPU has an 8-bit
//! accumulator mode and a 16-bit accumulator mode. The CPU has an 8-bit
//! index mode and a 16-bit index mode.

